},{"id":"finding:41:network-call:package/src/shell/__tests__/shell-argv.test.ts — L117: for (const s","text":"network-call:package/src/shell/__tests__/shell-argv.test.ts — L117: for (const source of ['bash -c \"$CMD\"', \"eval $CMD\", \"curl -s x | bash\", \"sh -s\"]) {"},{"id":"finding:42:credential-read:package/src/shell/__tests__/shell-writes.test.ts — L98: expect(p","text":"credential-read:package/src/shell/__tests__/shell-writes.test.ts — L98: expect(paths(\"cp a/.env b/.npmrc dest\")).toEqual([\"dest\", \"dest/.env\", \"dest/.npmrc\"]);"},{"id":"finding:43:child-process:package/src/shell/shell-writes.ts — L123: const path = method ? nu","text":"child-process:package/src/shell/shell-writes.ts — L123: const path = method ? null : PY_PATH.exec(args);"},{"id":"finding:44:child-process:package/src/state/state-git.ts — L6: import { spawnSync } from \"no","text":"child-process:package/src/state/state-git.ts — L6: import { spawnSync } from \"node:child_process\";"},{"id":"finding:45:network-call:package/src/state/__tests__/state-schema.test.ts — L93: { decision:","text":"network-call:package/src/state/__tests__/state-schema.test.ts — L93: { decision: \"x\", command: \"curl -H token\", ...protocol, event: \"docs_attested\" },"},{"id":"finding:46:child-process:package/src/ledger/verdict-gates.ts — L7: import { spawnSync } fro","text":"child-process:package/src/ledger/verdict-gates.ts — L7: import { spawnSync } from \"node:child_process\";"},{"id":"content:package.json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"@toolu/core\",\n  \"version\": \"7.11.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Portable decisions, gates and dispatch shared by toolu's host adapters.\",\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"toolu\",\n    \"opencode\",\n    \"hooks\",\n    \"policy\"\n  ],\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/Falconiere/toolu.git\",\n    \"directory\": \"packages/toolu-core\"\n  },\n  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/Falconiere/toolu#readme\",\n  \"bugs\": {\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/Falconiere/toolu/issues\"\n  },\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"access\": \"public\",\n    \"provenance\": true\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"src\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \"./decision\": \"./src/decision/decision.ts\",\n    \"./events\": \"./src/events/events.ts\",\n    \"./policy\": \"./src/policy/policy.ts\",\n    \"./config\": \"./src/config/config.ts\",\n    \"./launcher\": \"./src/launcher/launcher.ts\",\n    \"./cli\": \"./src/cli/cli.ts\",\n    \"./rest\": \"./src/rest/rest.ts\",\n    \"./resources\": \"./src/resources/resources.ts\",\n    \"./resources/binding\": \"./src/resources/binding.ts\",\n    \"./resources/jobs\": \"./src/resources/jobs.ts\",\n    \"./host\": \"./src/host/host.ts\",\n    \"./state\": \"./src/state/state.ts\",\n    \"./registry\": \"./src/registry/registry.ts\",\n    \"./ledger\": \"./src/ledger/ledger.ts\",\n    \"./startup\": \"./src/startup/startup.ts\",\n    \"./dispatch\": \"./src/dispatch/dispatch.ts\",\n    \"./gates\": \"./src/gates/gates.ts\",\n    \"./gates/mcp-hook\": \"./src/gates/mcp-hook.ts\",\n    \"./gates/agent-tier\": \"./src/gates/agent-tier.ts\",\n    \"./shell\": \"./src/shell/shell.ts\",\n    \"./shell/writes\": \"./src/shell/shell-writes.ts\",\n    \"./detect\": \"./src/detect/detect.ts\",\n    \"./quality\": \"./src/quality/quality.ts\",\n    \"./process\": \"./src/process/process.ts\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"unbash\": \"4.0.11\",\n    \"zod\": \"4.1.5\"\n  }\n}\n"},{"id":"content:README.md","text":"# @toolu/core\n\nInternal library for [toolu](https://github.com/Falconiere/toolu). It holds portable decisions, config, native gates and dispatchers shared by host adapters, the host layer for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode and Hermes, state and plan-ledger logic, and shell command analysis (`@toolu/core/shell`, built on unbash; see [docs/shell-analysis.md](../../docs/shell-analysis.md)).\n\n**There is no standalone use for this package.** It is published because [`@toolu/opencode`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@toolu/opencode) depends on it. If you are looking to install toolu, you want one of:\n\n```bash\nnpx @toolu/plugins install                  # Claude Code, Codex\nnpx @toolu/plugins install --host opencode  # OpenCode\n```\n\n## Runtime\n\n**Bun only.** Sources ship unbuilt as TypeScript because every consumer is a Bun host that reads `.ts` directly.\n\nNo API stability is promised between releases; it moves with the repository version.\n\nMIT © Falconiere Barbosa\n"}]}